WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:04.810
<i>A crane struck with lightning went out of control,
causing huge damage to the Cornucopia.</i>

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.480
<i>Currently they are rebuilding at a very fast—</i>

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:10.480
<i>WINNER'S Casino.
A door to a new future opens in March.</i>

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.480
THE MOMENT TO SOAR IS COMING!

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.860
<i>It's one in the morning.</i>

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:17.490
MIDNIGHT SARG

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:15.740
<i>A strange shadow appears
before the SARG officer during his patrol.</i>

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.490
<i>It's members of DoRed.</i>

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.540
<i>The land value of Shantytown
has tripled since last year.</i>

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:25.250
On the eve of Shantytown's redevelopment,
residents cry out because of increased rent.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:25.250
<i>Rent has skyrocketed, and many residents
have been evicted from their homes.</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:28.880
<i>There's no time to waste concerning
the deterioration of the Pylon Apartment.</i>

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:33.260
LIVE PRESS CONFERENCE

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.260
<i>It is my duty as the mayor to evict all residents
immediately to protect everyone's safety.</i>

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:37.260
<i>Let's utilize the KANAE System
for the safety of our children.</i>

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.720
NOVEMBER 27, 2021

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.140
Daisy's being rather noisy.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.930
Did something happen?

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.730
D-Damn you. What did you just say?

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:45.940
What I meant was...

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:49.150
So that children can be safe,
surveillance cameras need to—

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.320
Our shopping street have sympathetic people.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:52.990
We don't need stuff like that.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:57.280
You just don't get it. Can't you even come
to a mutual understanding?

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:58.200
Why you...

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.950
Okay, okay. Calm down.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.370
We'd like to listen to what you have to say.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.120
That old man's gonna pop a vein at some point.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.710
Everyone's on edge lately.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:10.500
What can we do about it?

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.130
<i>At times like this, Asumi would...</i>

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:16.880
Shu?

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.840
I'm going to the hospital.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.810
Oh, visiting Ms. Tsuzuragawa?

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.850
He's been going every day lately.

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.730
I should go to college, too.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.320
Why are there less rusks here?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.030
Is her family visiting or something?

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.540
Ms. Tsuzuragawa.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.460
Please tell me.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.040
Asumi is...

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.750
...still alive, isn't she?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.760
NOVEMBER 29, 2021

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.760
Koki, aren't you overexerting yourself?

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.840
That method isn't something
I can compliment as a member of SARG.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.970
It's an order from Gori Suido.
I trust you to do what is necessary.

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.730
Now, what should I do with this?

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.730
<i>Sheesh.</i>

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:40.440
NOVEMBER 30, 2021

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.400
<i>What in the world was Titty-gawa collecting?</i>

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:49.040
<i>Something that was placed deliberately
at the observation deck of the Cornucopia...</i>

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:54.920
<i>Maybe Instructor
would know her true identity?</i>

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.840
Hey, Ran. This is really bad.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.710
Look at this. This is really bad!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.510
Lucky, the way you said "bad" was...

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:06.970
YUMIHARIYU

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.430
Hey, is that really Kinako?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.850
Whoa, it really is!

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.350
Definitely real.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.230
Wh-Who are you guys?

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:18.400
Hey there. We used to be your fans.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.910
There are posts on the internet
that Kinako is a member of DoRed.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.200
Damn it. Who spilled it?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:31.660
Is it true that you're a member of DoRed?

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.710
Um...

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:37.590
You know, DoRed has been causing us
tons of trouble.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.090
H-Hold on.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.050
So they're haters of DoRed. Damn it.

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:52.060
- What're they doing to Kinako—
- Wait. It's a trap.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.850
Chikuwa?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.110
Damn it.

00:04:58.110 --> 00:04:59.270
You can't.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:04.610
If you get caught, DoRed will fall apart.
So I'll go instead.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.110
That's right.

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.070
No!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.070
What the hell are you doing?

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.160
What did Kinako do?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.660
If you got complaints, I'll take you on.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.000
Who the hell are you?

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.170
What pathetic guys.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.880
Kinako, you're not hurt, are you?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:35.020
Shu, you're really helping me out this time.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:40.980
But if SARG is staking out, then they must be
behind the leaked info about Kinako.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:44.070
So rules are completely
worthless now? Bring it on.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.780
Let's meet up with Kinako later. It's getting
too dangerous to be moving separately.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:54.540
<i>Stubborn, reckless,
and can't allow anything unjust.</i>

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.750
So cold.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.920
Shuta, huh?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.510
Kinako.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.520
Another error of unknown origin.

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:20.440
Oh, we got an "All Clear" report
from the SARG on site.

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:21.770
Yeah.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.980
<i>Near Yumihariyu...</i>

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:26.280
<i>So it definitely involves close acquaintances.</i>

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:30.280
This frequency of errors...
Shouldn't we report this to Mr. Gori?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.070
It's still within the margin of error.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.410
Understood.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.290
<i>At this rate, Hazard Cast will stop functioning.</i>

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.670
<i>Where did the observation data
that Tsuzuragawa collected disappear to?</i>

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.630
DECEMBER 5, 2021

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.220
You suddenly come back
from overseas and call me over?

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.010
Just tell me the identity of the thing
that was inside the KANAE System.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.470
Don't be so hasty. Come with me.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:05.650
It's been a while, Mr. Super Hacker.

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:12.700
You've got some nerve.
Because of you, Kunai...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:16.160
Are you satisfied with one blow?

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:24.540
Oh, brother. Both master and apprentice
are so hot-headed.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.920
Instructor, what are you doing
with a guy like this?

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:29.880
It's so I can overwrite the world with new art.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.260
New art?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:35.720
My objective is business.
I'll do anything if it makes money.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:41.770
Thanks to DoRed making a riot, we made
quite a bit from the stock market.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.900
I'm nothing like you.

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:50.570
The Graffiti War went viral on the internet,
but do you know who had set it in motion?

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.570
It can't be...

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:57.410
Yes. I can take an ordinary criminal
and set him up to be a revolutionist of justice.

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.870
We're on the same boat at this point.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:09.130
So were you able
to hack into the KANAE System?

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.460
With no issues.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.380
So what are you planning on doing?

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.140
We're hacking into democracy.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:21.140
Majority rule is a merciless system where one vote
can decide the outcome of a battle.

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:27.230
A preliminary poll shows that 53% are in favor
of the KANAE System referendum,

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:28.400
IN FAVOR

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:28.400
KANAE SYSTEM LOCAL REFERENDUM
POLLING

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:35.070
AGAINST

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.690
and 47% are against it.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:35.070
If more than 3% of the voters flip their decision,
the results will be the exact opposite.

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:40.200
And that's where this immense set of data
collected from these cPhones come in.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:45.880
Length of cPhone operating time, where they
are used, area of activity, personal tastes,

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:48.630
how often they are swayed by ads...

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:53.380
Based on personal information like that,
individual activity patterns are extracted

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.680
and personalities are profiled.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:09:01.430
Then, the 3% who are easily affected
by others and susceptible to changing opinions

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.850
are brought into the open.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:06.600
We verify the targets
by using the personal information database,

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:11.650
and along with using personalized ads,
excessive and radical information is focused on them.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:15.450
Once their emotions are rocked,
their sense of judgment plummets drastically

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:17.870
and make decisions
they wouldn't usually make.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.330
Insanity can be propagated instantaneously.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.950
I know that has happened overseas.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:28.000
But there's no guarantee the same algorithm
would work in the 24th Ward.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.080
There is.

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:31.880
The Graffiti War was the touchstone for it.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.800
The gap is closing?

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:36.800
FOURTH REPORT

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.090
DECEMBER 16, 2021

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:41.010
A powerful movement to go vote
is happening on the internet right now,

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.310
and the number of DoRed supporters
are increasing.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.060
Bracing for the forced eviction
of the Pylon Apartment,

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:49.020
a neighborhood watch
has been set up within Shantytown.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.190
SARG can no longer...

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.820
How about we ask the UN forces
for assistance?

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.200
We should be able to pressure them
through connections from Mr. Howard.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.200
Do we have to go that far?

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.410
It may not be enough.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:05.200
When you think about the long term,
it's not wise to owe Howard any favors.

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.410
I see.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.670
Then how about you utilize
the powers of Hazard Cast to the fullest?

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:15.630
Felons have no right to vote, huh?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.430
All right.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.680
REGARDING PYLON APARTMENT RESIDENTIAL AREA

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.680
SHANTYTOWN

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.680
We will forcibly execute
the eviction of Pylon Apartment.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:37.700
DoRed CONTINUES TO CAUSE DAMAGE

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.320
It's absurd to suddenly have
your home taken away!
There are a lot of people
who had no where to go
so they drifted into Shantytown.
There seems to be a lot of confusion.
And this is all so you can watch them
through the KANAE system, right?
Outrageous!

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.590
NO SURVEILLANCE SOCIETY

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.550
Kozue is in danger.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.010
DECEMBER 21, 2021

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:09.850
Is Shantytown really going to disappear?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:14.400
Everyone is acting upon
some kind of assertion.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.530
As a result, they're against each other.

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.530
Shu?

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.610
Help!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.740
Hey! I told you to stop!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:26.040
Hey you, it's for your own good
to calm down and stop!

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.160
Kozue?

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.660
I-I'm feeling some déjà vu?

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:29.870
- I'm heading down there.
- Okay.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:42.090
- Let go. Let me go!
- Calm down. Hey!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.680
No way. Why would I ever listen to SARG?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:47.970
You can't doodle on a police car.
You need to obey the law.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.680
And that law is screwed up.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:53.190
- Kaoru.
- Help me out here, Senpai.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.100
Look around.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:03.740
This isn't good.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.910
- Is that SARG?
- They're after a young girl.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.540
Let's get 'em!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.290
- That's right.
- Yeah!

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.410
- Unforgivable!
- How could you?

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:16.920
Wait!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:21.340
Shuta Aoi.

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.130
Run for it.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:22.930
But...

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:23.590
Just go!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.970
Ms. Shishido.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:25.930
Hurry up and go.

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:27.470
Hey, don't run away.

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.310
Come on now.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.520
Which side are you on?

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.730
It's not about friend or foe.

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:34.600
Don't give us stupid lip service.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.360
- Let's go.
- After them!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:39.190
We will protect our Shantytown.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.690
Kick SARG out!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.370
Big Brother Shu.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.040
Are you going to join DoRed?
Don't do that, it's dangerous.

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:55.620
You should help DoRed, too.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:59.420
You can't trust a machine with justice.
A society under surveillance is dangerous.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.090
Are you just echoing what DoRed says?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.220
That's right. Got a problem with that?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.470
Did you know that Kunai's grandma
was chased out of her home she loved so much?

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:12.430
Can you save her? Instead of only
chasing problems right in front of you?

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:15.390
Big Brother Shu, exactly whose hero are you?

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.860
I'm gonna go join DoRed.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:24.740
Kozue. Hey, wait.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.870
Don't allow SARG with their antics.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.620
Gather under the DoRed flag.

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:59.400
Asumi. It's getting dark.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.070
Let's go home.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:06.200
Mom always said that if I do what is right,

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:09.870
then someday the right things
will come back to me.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.790
But Mom died. Why is that?

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.540
That's because...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.420
Was Mom lying to me?

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:24.340
No way. What Mrs. Kanae said is surely true.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.460
So...

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:29.510
So I'll make sure stuff like this
won't happen ever again.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.140
I'll become your...

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.720
The 24th Ward's hero.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.190
Okay.

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:47.030
A hero? Yeah, right.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.160
The town is in such a state, and yet I...

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:56.120
I prioritized my own feelings, and I haven't
been thinking on behalf of someone else,

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:59.710
like our teachers or Asumi have been doing.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.840
HOSPITAL

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:05.210
From the hospital?

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.210
Hello?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.470
No... If you meet with her...

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:13.350
It's happening again.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:16.600
Have we figured out the reason
behind the abnormal alerts?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.730
MS. TSUZURAGAWA
HAS JUST REGAINED CONSCIOUSNESS.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.350
Chief?

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:23.190
We're currently working on that case.
Give us a little bit of time.

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:26.440
Sorry, but I have an emergency
and need to go to the hospital right now.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.150
SUSPECTED TERRORIST IDENTIFIED

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.070
<i>Shuta is a terrorist? Impossible.</i>

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.530
<i>That can't be...</i>

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.870
<i>What's the meaning of this, Asumi?</i>

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.920
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.170
<i>A good job of inducing
public opinion, wasn't it?</i>

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.170
SARG MANHANDLES A CIVILIAN GIRL!
ARE THERE NO DECENT
POLICE ORGANIZATIONS
IN THE 24TH WARD?

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.670
Well done.

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:53.140
Thanks to the supporters, we were able
to regain the hideout with no issues.

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.680
We'll launch our counterattack now.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.680
<i>Leave the broadcast preparations to us.</i>

00:16:00.430 --> 00:16:03.690
This place really is the most relaxing.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:07.530
It's a bit lonely here without you.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.490
So this is DoRed's headquarters.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:13.660
Kinako, you really were a member of DoRed.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.450
Yeah. Sorry I kept quiet about it.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.790
So you finally want to talk to me about this?

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:22.830
Well, there's no turning back now.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.920
The blueprints of the Cornucopia?

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.960
But this is different
from the one that's made public.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:31.260
This is the prototype
that Ms. Kanae was researching.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.090
It's the true guise of the KANAE System.

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:39.060
True guise?
What in the world is Gori Suido hiding?

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:44.690
I'm glad you regained consciousness.
How are you feeling?

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:49.440
Were you the one
who pulled me off the trolley tracks?

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.940
So you do know after all.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.200
I got a phone call from Asumi.

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:59.790
Once I picked up the phone,
a Vision of the future flooded into my head—

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.540
That is an SOS from Miss Asumi.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.460
Just as I thought. So Asumi is still alive and—

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.420
She has passed away.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.340
But the SOS from Asumi...

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:15.090
The situation is a bit complicated.
I will explain in due order.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:21.930
The premise that you must first know about
is the KANAE System.

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.690
It was originally developed by Lady Kanae.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.900
I am currently the lead developer.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:35.610
The development of the KANAE System
was at a standstill functionally.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.870
The original system designed by Lady Kanae

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:44.250
required a human brain as the arithmetic unit.

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:50.840
With the reason that it was inhumane,
Lady Kanae abandoned the research.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:56.470
However, Mr. Gori and I were forced
to put our future on the line for this project.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:58.220
Because Mrs. Kanae...

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.930
Yes. She was not someone
who should've died in such a way.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:08.190
We resumed our research, but in the end,
we could not create a viable substitute.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.440
Something that can substitute a human brain?

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:16.950
Right. However, there was a turning point
in the halted research a year and a half ago.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:21.700
If I said it was the Takara Elementary School fire,
would you understand?

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:22.910
That means...

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:30.920
Mr. Gori ordered me to transplant
Miss Asumi into the system core.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:34.420
That means inside KANAE System is...

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.630
Miss Asumi's corpse is being utilized.

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.640
No way. You're kidding me.

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:47.640
That's insane.
Why would you do such a thing?

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.480
So that a tragedy will never be repeated.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:57.030
Mr. Gori decided to use an inhumane system
for the sake of the 24th Ward.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:19:00.030
But that's going too far, isn't it?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:07.580
With the transplant, the KANAE System operated
smoothly as if it received an angel's blessing.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:12.040
Until that day when you three
received a phone call from Miss Asumi...

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:13.790
That phone call...

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:23.100
The fact that it sought help only from Mr. Koki,
you, and Mr. Ran gave me a bad premonition.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.970
Without a doubt,
Miss Asumi is biologically dead.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:31.400
But by connecting an organic brain to a machine
and running an electrical current,

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.690
what if a conscience was recreated?

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:37.190
So Asumi was brought back to life
within the KANAE System?

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:43.240
However, until we examine the details,
we couldn't allow it to be squashed as a bug.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:47.200
That is why I faked a hack
into the KANAE System.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.250
So that's why you called yourself Carneades?

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.540
To be blunt, it was to buy time.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:56.670
I had placed a mapping sensor in Cornucopia,

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.920
and observed the faint electrical currents
that enveloped the entire town.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.680
Normally, Miss Asumi's conscience
is distributed all over the system,

00:20:04.680 --> 00:20:06.720
so her presence cannot be perceived.

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:10.390
However, when particular individuals
are involved with Hazard Cast...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.400
Only when Miss Asumi's
acquaintances were involved,

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.940
we discovered the dispersed conscience
coagulated into a single point of focus.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:23.490
That means, Asumi was seeking our help
in the moments she returned to being herself?

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.870
The Visions are screams from Miss Asumi.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:30.000
She became a part of the KANAE System,
and in order to prevent the worst possible future,

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.920
she continues to see nightmares
that may happen within the 24th Ward.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.790
When she realizes that one of those futures
must become reality,

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:41.090
she cannot hold it within herself,
and so Miss Asumi wakes up,

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:44.050
and seeks help from you three
through trolley dilemmas.

00:20:45.430 --> 00:20:50.770
She was in agony, in pain,
and was seeking us for help.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:56.150
Each time she calls for help,
the KANAE System racks up more bugs.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:21:00.860
At this rate, I was afraid that Miss Asumi's
conscience may become reckless.

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:03.990
Thus, I decided to put her conscience
to an eternal slumber.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:09.450
If I have measured data through observation,
I can forcefully disperse her conscience

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.080
right before she wakes up from a nightmare.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.370
Theoretically, it's possible
to create such a program.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:20.920
In the end, that doesn't change the fact
that she keeps suffering from nightmares, right?

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:23.420
Are you going to continually
make Asumi suffer?

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.800
We have no other way.

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:29.930
I'm sorry.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:32.060
Please laugh at me.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:37.100
I know that Miss Asumi has passed away,
and it's merely a digital residue of her thoughts.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:40.400
But I don't want to eradicate that existence.

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:45.360
I don't know how to face Lady Kanae like this.

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.450
Ms. Tsuzuragawa.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:52.540
When I found out I was on the tracks
of destiny in the stormy Cornucopia,

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:54.750
I had already made up my mind.

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:57.880
I had committed that significant of a sin.

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:00.840
I made Miss Asumi shoulder the burden.

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:05.260
Death was a punishment suitable for me.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.260
However...

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:11.560
I was supposed to die, but I'm still alive.

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:14.730
It was because you saved me.

00:22:15.140 --> 00:22:17.520
It was because you didn't give up hope.

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:19.150
It was because you were a hero.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:24.490
I'd always thought
that heroes were nonsense.

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:30.910
But from you, I feel a train of thought
similar to Lady Kanae and Miss Asumi.

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:33.790
The same as both of them?

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:39.790
Mr. Shuta, how would you save Miss Asumi?

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:43.170
Instructor.

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:46.720
If this is true, then the KANAE System...

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:50.390
is definitely completely and utterly broken.

00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:54.970
Asumi, I will allow you to keep sleeping.

00:22:55.350 --> 00:22:59.060
Not in a nightmare.
I will create a rocking crib for you.

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.520
There's no need for you to be in agony.

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:09.030
I'm going to save Asumi?
